//! Parity of multi-output, batched and `ModelListGP` models, posterior
//! transforms and the constrained analytic acquisition functions with BoTorch
//! (fixtures in `tests/fixtures/phase4/*.json`, generated by
//! `scripts/generate_fixtures.py --phase 4`).
//!
//! * BoTorch's parameter names, shapes and flat order, default
//!   initialization, per-element MLL values and the autograd gradient of
//!   their sum;
//! * joint posteriors over all outputs (BoTorch's output-major covariance
//!   layout) with and without observation noise, for unbatched inputs
//!   broadcast over the model batch, batched inputs and extra input batch
//!   dimensions, and their derivatives with respect to the inputs;
//! * BoTorch's batched independent fits (per-element final losses);
//! * acquisition values and gradients with a `ScalarizedPosteriorTransform`
//!   (analytic, MC with BoTorch's base samples, qLogNEI,
//!   `prune_inferior_points`) and of `LogConstrainedExpectedImprovement` /
//!   `ConstrainedExpectedImprovement`.
//!
//! Errors are mixed elementwise/normwise relative errors (`common::rel_err`);
//! log-space acquisition values are compared by `|a - e| / max(|e|, 1)`.
//! Run with `--nocapture` to print the error tables.

